{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_12_level_main_12-13_end","groupId":"main_12","stageId":"main_12-13","title":"千瘡百孔","storyCode":"12-15","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_12-13_end.txt","sourceHash":"db49fbd3c8ab85176eda61c606f19896c1a77e33c3533adf2ef18966889c6849","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"“灰禮帽”們確認了阿米婭的魔王身份。推進之王制定了鼓動諾伯特區居民自救的計劃。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g4_fogblockadestreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"離伊內絲小姐約定的日出已經沒有幾個小時了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們需要加快撤離行動的步伐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽” (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，你們是不是忘了什麼更重要的事呢，羅德島的博士？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"還有飛空艇。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽” (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我們重新和深池站在了同一條起跑線上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽” (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就意味著，需要抓緊時間了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽” (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"永遠信守承諾，這不光是我們對自己的要求......也是對交易對象的要求。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽” (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們終於來了，我差點被赤鐵近衛隊的那小子幹掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽” (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公爵閣下對你的怠惰很不滿意。你的手段太過溫吞了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽” (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是說，你是在拉攏亞歷山德莉娜？向她賣賣人情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽” (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這是個很嚴重的指控，我當然絕對忠誠於公爵閣下，只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽” (C)","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們之後會審閱你的辯詞的，不過現在沒有時間了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽” (C)","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別動，羅德島的傢伙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們想幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽” (C)","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑色的法術......和那份新情報上說的一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽” (C)","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們隱瞞得很不錯，羅德島，這一位卡特斯居然是薩卡茲的魔王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽” (C)","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很有意思......這或許確實是需要你才能解決的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽” (C)","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"詩人，沒能發現這一點也是你工作上的失職。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽” (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......公爵閣下希望我用什麼辦法補救？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽” (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你和深池聊天的這段時間裡，我們已經確定了飛空艇船塢的位置，那裡......很棘手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽” (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但那份情報告訴我們，“魔王”會有辦法處理的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽” (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，小小的魔王，你會配合我們的行動，對吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽” (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個溫德米爾家的小姑娘呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽” (C)","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別給自己找將功補過的機會了，飛空艇的技術是第一優先順序。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g1_glasgowboxinggym"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能找到的人我們應該都通知到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們能做的，也就是這些了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭還沒有回來，也沒有收到博士和伊內絲的聯絡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......外面好像又有地方在著火了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是，酒店的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們最好去看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戴菲恩？怎麼跑得那麼急？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——那些羅德島的人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就直說了吧，聽好，亞歷山德莉娜·維娜·維多利亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭和博士被“灰禮帽”要求繼續完成那場交易，他們必須去尋找飛空艇的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威靈頓公爵的軍隊已經進入了這個地塊，開斯特公爵的增援恐怕也到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們都對薩卡茲那架飛空艇的技術勢在必得，他們都無法接受自己的競爭對手首先獲得技術上的優勢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"諾伯特區已經成了公爵們角力的圍場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，果然是那些人的一貫作風。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那條廣播呢？你說的，能推動大公爵們正式進攻這裡的廣播——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊內絲小姐說，她會盡量做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盡量做到？這是什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她說，等到日出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假設大公爵們依然會採取正面行動，我們還有多少時間？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果伊內絲小姐成功......溫德米爾公爵的高速軍艦會在日出後不久靠近這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們在這裡聚集了很多人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些不在這裡的人，應該也已經收到消息了，願意跟著我們的人會跟上隊伍的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我建議在大公爵的軍艦正式靠近之前，我們應該繼續在這裡等待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眼下的情況......走在街道上不是個好主意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論是威靈頓還是開斯特，他們對有可能妨礙他們的人都從不手軟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我們最好現在就出發。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"封鎖牆邊的幾個薩卡茲駐軍營地被襲擊了，很可能就是某位大公爵的部隊幹的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們應該趁著現在還是夜裡，盡量靠近那些封鎖牆防守比較薄弱的地帶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更重要的是......我們要讓還躲在窗戶後面張望的那些人知道，我們說的是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次撤離不是個為了騙取他們僅剩儲備的陰謀，不是個薩卡茲剿滅他們的陷阱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"重新建立信任是困難的，而唯一的方法不過是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓他們看見實際的行動。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G1_interrogat_room"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喏，這幾本是你上次托我帶的書。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可在那些倫蒂尼姆的圖書館裡找了半天，我又不懂維多利亞語，最後是抓了個可憐的菲林才幫你找到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看你有時還會在另一個空白的本子上寫寫畫畫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不光看書，還會自己寫東西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒去過卡茲戴爾，但聽說那裡的地窖裡甚至還有間薩卡茲的大學。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是那裡的老師？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我和你一樣，為人賣命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些書真的這麼好看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是些差不多的結論，只是相似的情形一遍遍上演。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作者們就只能繼續得出這些差不多的結論。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我同樣覺得膩煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曼弗雷德將軍讓我們把你關在這裡，卻一直沒有進一步的指令......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是怎麼得罪他了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許，他只是覺得，對於我來說，監獄更安靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這裡......更方便我做些真正願意去做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真正願意去做的事情就是看書？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你可真夠無聊的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說......我們薩卡茲很快就要有個真正的好消息了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能夠震撼整片大地的好消息！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無非是又一場戰爭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有沒有人和你說過，跟你聊天很沒勁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是真有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......更沒勁了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，我要換班了。你老實在這裡待著吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別忘了答應我的，幫你找書的報酬——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"王庭軍士兵的身影晃晃悠悠地消失在監獄走廊的盡頭，很快，另一串腳步聲就會響起。\n赫德雷等待著。\n但是只有寂靜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g9_airshipdockcorridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"船員們都已經登上飛空艇了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明椒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......我在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看過一本......叫《薩卡茲戰爭史》的書嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你該看看，我的抽屜裡有一本，你可以拿去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是個很精彩的故事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是一本戰爭史。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您已經說了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你就不該問這樣的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不認同這本書中的幾乎一切觀點，軟弱，悲哀，破碎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我仍然承認，那是本浸透著鮮血的書。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位作者又會怎麼描述我們眼下的這場戰爭呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我同樣好奇。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
